{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;MAHOROBA CAT is a photo-adventure game in which you travel around Japan's famous tourist destinations. Commissioned by your boss to take photos for a travel magazine, the protagonist sets off on a journey to various locations across Japan. Explore beautifully rendered voxel landscapes, including iconic landmarks, hidden gems, and everyday scenes, and aim to capture the perfect shot! The game enhances the travel experience with features such as staying in hotels and traveling between locations by train or bus, immersing players in the excitement of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hold up your camera and take the best shot!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/steam_page_09.gif?t=1743867486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tourist attractions throughout Japan!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can easily visit tourist attractions throughout the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/steam_page_08.png?t=1743867486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expanding World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage inversion system allows you to explore every corner of the diorama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244270/extras/steam_page_05.gif?t=1743867486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3244270?t=1743867486","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3244270?t=1743867486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps